&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh24.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">24/7 Support</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Our customer team is always available to help you on the road, wherever you are.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 relative transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 duration-300\"><img alt=\"Fast Pickup &amp; Return\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh25.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">Fast Pickup &amp; Return</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">Skip the counter and drive away in minutes with our digital check-in system.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 relative transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 duration-300\"><img alt=\"Transparent Pricing\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fwhychooseus%2Fh26.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-[18px] md:text-[20px] group-hover:text-[#66DF75] transition-colors\">Transparent Pricing</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed\">What you see is what you pay — no hidden fees, no surprises.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 p-6 rounded-sm transition-colors cursor-pointer group \"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 relative transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 duration-300\"><img alt=\"Flexible Booking Options\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fw